@startuml Post Question Sequence

title Sequence 1: Post a Question with Tags

actor User
participant QuestionController
participant QuestionService
participant TagService
database Questions
database Tags

User -> QuestionController: POST /api/questions\n{title, body, tags, authorId}
activate QuestionController

QuestionController -> QuestionService: postQuestion(authorId, title, body, tags)
activate QuestionService

QuestionService -> QuestionService: questionId = idCounter.incrementAndGet()
QuestionService -> QuestionService: create Question object

QuestionService -> TagService: addTags(tags)
activate TagService

loop for each tag
    TagService -> Tags: computeIfAbsent(tag, new Tag)
    Tags --> TagService: Tag
    TagService -> TagService: tag.incrementUsage()
end

TagService --> QuestionService: tags processed
deactivate TagService

QuestionService -> Questions: put(questionId, question)
QuestionService --> QuestionController: Question
deactivate QuestionService

QuestionController --> User: 201 Created\n{questionId, title, tags, createdAt}
deactivate QuestionController

@enduml

@startuml Answer and Voting Sequence

title Sequence 2: Answer Question and Voting

actor User1 as "Author"
actor User2 as "Voter"
participant AnswerController
participant AnswerService
participant VoteController
participant VoteService
participant UserService
database Answers
database Votes
database Users

Author -> AnswerController: POST /api/answers\n{questionId, body, authorId}
activate AnswerController

AnswerController -> AnswerService: postAnswer(questionId, authorId, body)
activate AnswerService

AnswerService -> AnswerService: answerId = idCounter.incrementAndGet()
AnswerService -> Answers: put(answerId, answer)
AnswerService --> AnswerController: Answer
deactivate AnswerService

AnswerController --> Author: 201 Created\n{answerId, body}
deactivate AnswerController

== Voting Phase ==

Voter -> VoteController: POST /api/votes/upvote\n{userId, targetId, targetType}
activate VoteController

VoteController -> VoteService: upvote(userId, targetId, targetType)
activate VoteService

VoteService -> VoteService: acquire write lock
VoteService -> VoteService: check existing vote

alt No Previous Vote
    VoteService -> VoteService: create new Vote(UPVOTE)
    VoteService -> Votes: put(voteKey, vote)

    VoteService -> AnswerService: answer.incrementVotes()
    activate AnswerService
    AnswerService -> AnswerService: voteCount.incrementAndGet()
    deactivate AnswerService

    VoteService -> UserService: updateReputation(authorId, +10)
    activate UserService
    UserService -> Users: user.addReputation(10)
    deactivate UserService

else Vote Exists (same direction)
    VoteService --> VoteController: AlreadyVotedException
else Vote Exists (opposite direction)
    VoteService -> VoteService: remove old vote
    VoteService -> AnswerService: answer.decrementVotes()
    VoteService -> VoteService: apply new vote
    VoteService -> AnswerService: answer.incrementVotes()
end

VoteService -> VoteService: release lock
VoteService --> VoteController: success
deactivate VoteService

VoteController --> Voter: 200 OK
deactivate VoteController

@enduml

@startuml Search Sequence

title Sequence 3: Search Questions (Concurrent)

actor User1
actor User2
participant QuestionController
participant SearchService
participant QuestionService
database Questions

par Concurrent Searches
    User1 -> QuestionController: GET /api/questions/search?keyword=java
    activate QuestionController

    QuestionController -> SearchService: search(criteria)
    activate SearchService

    SearchService -> QuestionService: searchByKeywords("java")
    activate QuestionService

    QuestionService -> Questions: stream values
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: filter by keyword in title/body
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: sort by votes DESC

    QuestionService --> SearchService: List<Question>
    deactivate QuestionService

    SearchService --> QuestionController: results
    deactivate SearchService

    QuestionController --> User1: 200 OK\n[questions]
    deactivate QuestionController

else
    User2 -> QuestionController: GET /api/questions/search?tag=spring
    activate QuestionController

    QuestionController -> SearchService: search(criteria)
    activate SearchService

    SearchService -> QuestionService: searchByTag("spring")
    activate QuestionService

    QuestionService -> Questions: stream values
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: filter by tag
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: sort by votes DESC

    QuestionService --> SearchService: List<Question>
    deactivate QuestionService

    SearchService --> QuestionController: results
    deactivate SearchService

    QuestionController --> User2: 200 OK\n[questions]
    deactivate QuestionController
end

note right
    Both searches execute
    concurrently. ConcurrentHashMap
    ensures thread-safe reads.
end note

@enduml

@startuml Accept Answer Sequence

title Sequence 4: Accept Answer

actor Author as "Question Author"
participant QuestionController
participant QuestionService
participant AnswerService
participant UserService
database Questions
database Answers
database Users

Author -> QuestionController: POST /api/questions/{qid}/accept/{aid}
activate QuestionController

QuestionController -> QuestionService: acceptAnswer(questionId, answerId)
activate QuestionService

QuestionService -> Questions: get(questionId)
Questions --> QuestionService: Question

alt Question Not Found
    QuestionService --> QuestionController: QuestionNotFoundException
else Question Found
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: verify author

    alt Not Author
        QuestionService --> QuestionController: UnauthorizedException
    else Is Author
        QuestionService -> AnswerService: getAnswer(answerId)
        activate AnswerService
        AnswerService -> Answers: get(answerId)
        Answers --> AnswerService: Answer
        AnswerService --> QuestionService: Answer
        deactivate AnswerService

        QuestionService -> QuestionService: question.setAcceptedAnswer(answerId)
        QuestionService -> Questions: update question

        QuestionService -> AnswerService: markAccepted(answerId)
        activate AnswerService
        AnswerService -> Answers: answer.setAccepted(true)
        deactivate AnswerService

        QuestionService -> UserService: updateReputation(answerAuthorId, +15)
        activate UserService
        UserService -> Users: user.addReputation(15)
        deactivate UserService

        QuestionService --> QuestionController: success
    end
end

deactivate QuestionService

QuestionController --> Author: 200 OK
deactivate QuestionController

@enduml
